## 🎯 Objective

Today's objective was to learn how Linux administrators securely access remote systems using SSH and transfer files using SCP. I also learned the difference between Public and Private IP addresses, how Network Address Translation (NAT) works, and how to troubleshoot secure remote access and network connectivity issues.

